                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e0a07bf-2d45-4470-b72a-b7dc38b12fd1",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5a877e3-bc8a-3365-9b4b-3946347f59d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "391942ab-dd1f-31f8-b459-d3f03b59dca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gynäkologe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gynäkologe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fe12212-642d-36e6-ad9d-f4039cee26fe",
                                        "entry_id": "80f47a0b-11d2-3bed-a01f-16f3ec31ed82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein auf Frauenheilkunde (Gynäkologie) spezialisierter Arzt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eb23c70-edaa-4179-935a-1de6a547e723",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe12212-642d-36e6-ad9d-f4039cee26fe",
                                                "text": "Sie hat einen Termin beim Gynäkologen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e4150d8-c79a-4528-a246-1f4f87342496",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe12212-642d-36e6-ad9d-f4039cee26fe",
                                                "text": "„Um dem abzuhelfen, machten sich Soziologen, Analytiker, Gynäkologen, Psychologen und diverse Sachbuchautoren an die Arbeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73a7c8f1-75af-475c-b0a9-0b0d9e55475d",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe12212-642d-36e6-ad9d-f4039cee26fe",
                                                "text": "„Ihr Vater war in Berlin ein bekannter Gynäkologe, sie selbst wurde eine begabte Lyrikerin.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ff0c2c5-95ed-47b0-a659-317f6b691f4a",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5a877e3-bc8a-3365-9b4b-3946347f59d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "391942ab-dd1f-31f8-b459-d3f03b59dca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "gynaecologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gynaecologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                        "entry_id": "b4095ec5-c517-30b2-b94f-054b127fb377",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of gynecologist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Commonwealth",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9fbb636-0ee8-4e8c-8126-b1122add107a",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "In the last analysis, the fate of each individual woman rests in the hands of the gynaecologist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed1a65a2-f1b8-4d4c-abbd-021cc91648c2",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "Since there is an important bill under study today, we are asked to hope that a gynaecologist will sit on a therapeutic committee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "101f4f2a-fe84-4738-b162-56d4618eb11a",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "During the past 5 years considerable interest has been shown by gynaecologists in the technique of laparoscopy (Steptoe, 1967; Cohen, 1970)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "063c19f5-209b-4078-b592-78453e203993",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "According to the Bill, from the moment that the embryo insertion has been completed, the authority for the gynaecologist to have an embryo in his possession immediately and automatically ends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1909ef6-6761-4cdd-ad67-8e3966511bbd",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "Mr Shikuku: […]Was there any gynaecologist among those doctors?\nMr. Angatia: Mr. Speaker, Sir, there was a gynaecologist and also a midwife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f56c179c-02f5-4cf0-8e0e-874863b2ba40",
                                                "sense_id": "be424251-fdaa-349b-8a89-e25f98bf5717",
                                                "text": "2009, India Today, Volume 34, Issues 36-43, page 592,\nWith one of the highest birth rates across the world (22.69 births per thousand), one can be sure that no gynaecologist will be without work in India."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "679ffd2d-e74a-4311-b4f1-e14342bc8d1a",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5a877e3-bc8a-3365-9b4b-3946347f59d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "391942ab-dd1f-31f8-b459-d3f03b59dca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "gynecologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gynecologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a32088b-b755-31d6-95f4-da82b3f5e6ba",
                                        "entry_id": "164baae8-ff74-3fbd-9437-97751b0e3101",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A physician specializing in diseases of the female reproductive system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd54cc78-79c9-4723-b412-a4b3aa58c78f",
                                                "sense_id": "4a32088b-b755-31d6-95f4-da82b3f5e6ba",
                                                "text": "Dr. Schirren: The members of this round table keep on speaking about urologists and gynecologists but you never mention andrologists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea241b98-1111-481b-981f-47a97c7ab8b6",
                                                "sense_id": "4a32088b-b755-31d6-95f4-da82b3f5e6ba",
                                                "text": "From now on, too, general practitioners should, as Southard emphasized, be urged to be at least as familiar with the general principles and methods of the psychiatrist as they are with those of the gynecologist, the dermatologist, and the pædiatrist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c66a8bed-a961-46c3-af4c-04e673115bf8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5a877e3-bc8a-3365-9b4b-3946347f59d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "391942ab-dd1f-31f8-b459-d3f03b59dca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "gynécologue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gynécologue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3db34cb3-b08f-3256-bfaf-6bc1063351d9",
                                        "entry_id": "f8293030-0560-32fc-b343-d77097863e0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médecin spécialisé en gynécologie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c30d5365-bbc0-45a3-97aa-e4b62d00c71d",
                                                "sense_id": "3db34cb3-b08f-3256-bfaf-6bc1063351d9",
                                                "text": "Pour Annie Bureau-Roger, gynécologue, « une femme dans sa globalité, c'est une femme qui accouche, qui se contracepte, qui fait l’amour, qui fait des IVG et qu'on soigne ; l’IVG fait partie de la vie. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d2dec7a-b422-4d97-a1cb-950de1658b04",
                                                "sense_id": "3db34cb3-b08f-3256-bfaf-6bc1063351d9",
                                                "text": "L’ostéoporose se diagnostique en premier lieu par l’examen d’ostéodensitométrie (ou « densitométrie osseuse » au cours d’un interrogatoire détaillé chez le généraliste ou le gynécologue au moment de la ménopause."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9967ad85-9a58-4385-893c-48b9610f124a",
                                                "sense_id": "3db34cb3-b08f-3256-bfaf-6bc1063351d9",
                                                "text": "1957 : l’ingénieur anglais Tom Brown et le gynécologue Ian Donald créent la première sonde échographique et l’utilisent en gynécologie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
